Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">微信联合华为小米等手机厂商推出A2A助手，实现系统级AI直接调动微信</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">原生多模态大模型LongCat-Next正式开源，引入DiNA架构实现视觉语音统一</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">GPT-5.5与DeepSeek V4 Pro在网络安全攻防实测中表现突出</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌发布Gemma 4 12B多模态模型，采用无编码器架构支持16GB内存本地运行</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d8524f47f02d694facc0fc6a0e7a3838.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌于6月3日发布统一多模态模型Gemma 4 12B，通过取消传统视觉与音频编码器，采用轻量级嵌入层直接处理多模态输入，大幅降低计算复杂度。该模型拥有120亿参数，仅需16GB显存或统一内存即可在消费级硬件上本地部署。性能方面，Gemma 4 12B的多步推理与Agent能力逼近26B MoE模型，并集成多Token预测（MTP）技术以提升端侧推理速度。目前该模型已采用Apache 2.0许可证开源，支持Ollama、LM Studio、MLX、SGLang及vLLM等主流推理框架，并提供AI Edge Gallery端侧部署包。此次架构创新显著降低了高性能多模态模型的运行门槛，为开发者在本地离线处理复杂视觉与音频任务提供了高效方案。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">比亚迪首次证实自研人形机器人“尧舜禹”2026年将内部分署2万台</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d565b5c35d2bbde027a0ee249a992429.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">比亚迪首次证实自研人形机器人“尧舜禹”2026年将内部分署2万台AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Jun 4, 2026147比亚迪执行副总裁李柯近日首次证实，公司正稳步推进自研工业人形机器人项目，代号“尧舜禹”，标志着这家全球最大新能源车企正式开启具身智能第二增长曲线。该项目于2022年由第十五事业部立项，中央研究院技术支撑，目前核心研发团队超4000人。截至2026年5月，原型机已迭代至第七代，核心零部件产线同步投产。“尧舜禹”双足行走速度达1.5米/秒，额定负载50公斤，配备4指16自由度灵巧手及激光雷达+6D触觉感知系统。目前，约150台样机已在深圳坪山、长沙等工厂实训，在搬运、贴标等工序中效率达人工的80%，并实现与优必选Walker S1及无人物流设备的协同作业。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微信联合华为小米等手机厂商推出A2A助手，实现系统级AI直接调动微信</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/cc2d562fbe3553426b3429954229753c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微信近日宣布与华为、小米、荣耀、OPPO等多家主流手机厂商达成深度合作，联合推出基于A2A（Agent-to-Agent）协作机制的助手能力。该功能将微信的高频沟通服务深度融入手机原生系统，用户可通过系统级AI助手直接发起微信音视频通话或发送消息。腾讯客服证实，目前多家厂商已完成系统接入，并采用双重授权机制确保用户数据安全与隐私。此次合作标志着AI智能体生态从“孤岛互联”向“端云协同”演进，通过跨生态底层打通，大幅缩短了用户操作链路。对于行业而言，这种系统级助手与超级应用的深度耦合，为端侧AI应用生态的成熟提供了关键范式，不仅提升了手机系统AI的实用价值，也实现了微信在国民级应用场景下的服务外延。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">原生多模态大模型LongCat-Next正式开源，引入DiNA架构实现视觉语音统一</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/1bcbc14f2da19de92c3a679e7c800c0a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">原生多模态大模型LongCat-Next及其核心离散分词器正式开源，旨在通过DiNA（离散原生自回归）架构打破模态阻隔，使AI能像处理文字一样原生地理解物理世界。该架构将图像、声音和文字统一转化为同源离散Token，共享参数与注意力机制。技术上，团队首创dNaViT视觉分词器，支持原生任意分辨率，通过8层残差向量量化实现28倍像素压缩。在LongCat-Flash-Lite MoE（68.5B参数，3B激活）基座测试中，其OmniDocBench表现超越Qwen3-Omni及Qwen3-VL，且在MMLU-Pro、C-Eval及SWE-Bench等文本与代码任务中保持领先。该模型还支持低延迟并行语音生成与个性化克隆，目前已在GitHub与HuggingFace全量开源，为行业提供了一种极简且轻量化的原生多模态部</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">GPT-5.5与DeepSeek V4 Pro在网络安全攻防实测中表现突出</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/97e0da57e2103d5ec8cf42c69e3ccbf6.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">安全研究员Kasra Rahjerdi近日发布大模型网络安全攻防实测报告，通过模拟黑客攻击故意留有漏洞的APK，测试主流LLM的漏洞利用能力。在限时2小时、单次预算10美元的测试中，GPT-5.5展现出统治级推理能力，以70%的成功率位列第一，但单次成功利用成本高达9.46美元。DeepSeek V4 Pro则凭借极高性价比脱颖而出，以0.62美元的单次成功成本位居榜首，成本仅为GPT-5.5的十五分之一。此外，Claude Sonnet 4.6与Opus 4.8各取得2次成功，Gemini 3.1 Pro Preview则因安全护栏过严未能完成任务。该测试揭示了模型在自动化安全审计中的潜力，未来网络安全防御或将演变为算力与模型策略的深度博弈。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
